xbrli:xbrl.ind-as:DetailsOfNatureOfExceptionalItems:
Exceptional items comprise of impairment of Goodwill for 
      the year ended 30 June 2024 as a result of reassessment of future 
      prospects on account of the business environment of the Cash Generating 
      Unit.
&nbsp;
